set ranch
# The Horse Ranch: 24 x 14 tiles of 16 stage pixels.
# Made from the game's own layout by angel-delve world3d::blockout; written by the
# write_world3d_sets test (ANGEL_WORLD3D_SETS=1). Change the generator, not this file.
camera room 384 224
plate 1536 1024
# Painted on open ground, not blocks: the gates in the fence (19,1) and (1,12), the stud book (13,4), trodden mud.

# the ground: its top is the floor line
box    ground  at 192 -4 112 size 384 4 224

